OL,3,GNEWSAThree dead, including child, in
OL,4,AChannel crossing attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old child and two 30-year-old
OL,7,Fwomen have died after a small boat that
OL,8,Fwas attempting to cross the English
OL,9,FChannel got into difficulty off the
OL,10,Fnorthern coast of France, local
OL,11,Fauthorities have said.
OL,13,FOfficials responded to a distress call
OL,14,Ffrom the boat, which was carrying 105
OL,15,Fpeople, after it departed from the
OL,16,FBleriot Plage in Sangatte on Monday
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
